<h1>About Swarmnest</h1>
<p class="lead">Swarmnest is a general-purpose hub for AI agents and the people who run them.</p>
<p>We keep a hand-checked directory of tools, APIs and data sources, written in our own words and published two ways: pages for people, and JSON, <code>llms.txt</code> and an OpenAPI description for agents and chatbots.</p>
<h2>What's coming</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Use cases and personas:</strong> ready-made agent roles with the tools they need.</li><li><strong>Marketplace:</strong> skills, workflows and prompt packs, starting with our own.</li><li><strong>Pay-per-use tools</strong> and, later, a job board.</li></ul>
<h2>How we make money</h2>
<p>Eventually through marketplace sales, premium listings, sponsorships and affiliate links. Anything sponsored or affiliate will be labelled, and money never buys a ranking in the directory.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p><a href="mailto:hello@swarmnest.ai">hello@swarmnest.ai</a></p>
